<title>CANADA: Seagram Co Ltd Q3 March 31 share net rises.</title>
<headline>Seagram Co Ltd Q3 March 31 share net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>MONTREAL, April 30 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1997			    1996</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.07		  US$0.04</p>
<p> Net			 27,000		   13,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,847,000		2,635,000</p>
